{
  "title": "How to scan your signature with a phone",
  "description": "No scanner? Get a clean, sharp signature for IBPS, SSC or RRB forms with just your phone — the right pen, paper, light, crop and KB size.",
  "lang": "en",
  "slug": "scan-signature-with-phone",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z",
  "relatedExams": [
    "ssc-cgl",
    "rrb-alp",
    "ibps-po",
    "upsc-cse",
    "bihar-police-constable"
  ],
  "relatedTools": [
    "signature-resize",
    "compress-image",
    "resize-image"
  ],
  "order": 2,
  "draft": false,
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The signature is the one document every exam asks for. SSC and RRB no longer let you upload a photo — it is captured live — but you still upload a signature. And a bad signature scan is one of the top reasons for rejection."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You do not need a scanner. A phone camera is enough if you do five things right."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "What you need"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "A "
            },
            {
              "text": "plain white A4 sheet",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " (no lines, no stains). Printer paper is perfect."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "A "
            },
            {
              "text": "black gel pen",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " or a black ball pen that writes dark. Most notices say black ink; banking accepts black, RRB asks for black."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Daylight from a window, or a bright room light."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Your phone."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Avoid blue ballpoint if you can. It turns pale grey after compression and some portals reject faint signatures."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Step 1: Sign properly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Sign in your "
            },
            {
              "text": "normal running signature",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " — the one you will also sign at the exam centre. If it differs on the day, you can be stopped."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Do not sign in capital letters.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " IBPS, SBI and RBI notices say this clearly. A signature in block capitals is treated as invalid."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Sign "
            },
            {
              "text": "bigger than usual",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " — about 6–8 cm wide. A bigger signature keeps its detail when it is shrunk to 140 × 60 pixels."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Sign two or three times on the sheet. Pick the cleanest one later."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Special formats"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "UPSC (CSE, NDA, CDS):",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " sign "
            },
            {
              "text": "three times, one below another",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ", and capture all three in one image. The final image is square, 350–500 px, 20–100 KB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Bihar Police Constable:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " two separate signature files — one in "
            },
            {
              "text": "Hindi",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ", one in "
            },
            {
              "text": "English",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ", each 15–25 KB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "RRB:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " the signature should sit centred in a 35 × 20 mm box. Sign so it fits in a box of that shape."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Step 2: Light it right"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The goal is pure white paper and pure black ink, with no shadow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Put the sheet on a flat table near a window."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Hold the phone "
            },
            {
              "text": "directly above",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " the paper, parallel to it. A tilted phone makes the signature look slanted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Check that your hand or phone is not casting a shadow on the signature. Move to the side of the light if needed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Turn the flash "
            },
            {
              "text": "off",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ". Flash makes a shiny spot in the middle."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Step 3: Take the photo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Fill most of the screen with the signature, leaving a small margin."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Tap on the signature to focus. Wait a second before you click."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Take two or three photos. Zoom in on the phone and pick the sharpest."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Do not use the phone’s document-scanner mode with heavy filters. It sometimes eats the thin parts of the signature."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Step 4: Clean, crop and resize"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Open "
        },
        {
          "text": "Signature Resize",
          "href": "/tools/signature-resize"
        },
        {
          "text": " on SahiSize, or go straight to your exam page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Pick your photo.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " It stays on your phone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Crop tight.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Leave only a thin white border. The ink should fill at least 80% of the box width. SSC specifically rejects signatures that are too small inside the image."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Clean.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " The cleanup option makes the paper pure white and the ink dark, and removes grey shadows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Resize to your exam.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Pick the exam and SahiSize sets the pixels and KB."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Check the ticks",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " — KB, pixels and format all green — and download."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Signature sizes for common exams"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Always check the latest official notice — these are the values from recent notices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "head": [
        [
          {
            "text": "Exam"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Pixels"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "KB"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "IBPS PO",
              "href": "/exam/ibps-po"
            },
            {
              "text": ", SBI, RBI"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "140 × 60 px"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "10–20 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "SSC CGL",
              "href": "/exam/ssc-cgl"
            },
            {
              "text": ", CHSL, MTS, CPO"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "6.0 × 2.0 cm ≈ 472 × 157 px at 200 DPI"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "10–20 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "RRB ALP",
              "href": "/exam/rrb-alp"
            },
            {
              "text": ", Group D, NTPC"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "at least 140 × 60 px"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "30–49 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "NEET UG, JEE Main"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "KB only"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "10–100 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "CUET UG, UGC NET"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "KB only"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "10–50 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "UPSC CSE",
              "href": "/exam/upsc-cse"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "350–500 px square (3 signatures)"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "20–100 KB"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "text": "CTET"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "3.5 × 1.5 cm"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "text": "3–30 KB"
            }
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "SSC gives only centimetres. At 200 DPI, 6.0 × 2.0 cm works out to about 472 × 157 pixels — that is what SahiSize uses by default."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The RRB problem: signature too small in KB"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "RRB wants 30–49 KB. A clean black-on-white signature is so simple that it often compresses to only 10–15 KB, even at full quality. Then the portal says the file is too small."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You do not need to fake it by adding noise yourself. SahiSize’s RRB preset handles it: it first uses the highest quality, then a larger pixel size within the allowed range, and only if needed adds a very faint grain or white padding. The signature looks the same, and the file reaches 30 KB."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Common mistakes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Signature on lined or ruled paper.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " The lines show up. Use plain paper."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Photo of the screen.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " Never photograph a signature shown on another screen; it becomes blurry with moiré lines."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Using an old signature image.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " If you signed differently three years ago, make a fresh one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Wrong orientation.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " The image must be landscape (wider than tall) for most exams, except UPSC which is square."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Saving from WhatsApp.",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " WhatsApp re-compresses images. Transfer by cable or use the original file."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "FAQ"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Can I sign on paper with blue ink?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Some exams allow blue, but black is safer: it stays dark after compression. RRB and SSC prefer black. Check your notice."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Can I use a digital signature drawn on the screen?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "No. Exams want your handwritten signature on paper, photographed or scanned. A finger-drawn signature looks different from how you sign at the centre."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "My signature is very small. Will it still work?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Crop tightly so the ink fills the box. If it looks thin and broken after resizing, sign again bigger with a thicker pen."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Is my signature uploaded anywhere?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "No. SahiSize processes everything inside your browser. Nothing is sent to our server. SahiSize is not affiliated with any exam body."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Next: "
        },
        {
          "text": "How to make a thumb impression",
          "href": "/guides/thumb-impression-for-exam-forms"
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "handwritten declaration format",
          "href": "/guides/handwritten-declaration-format"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
